	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0801_workman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すなあらしは　たいへんだ！▼
だがな　いわタイプ　じめんタイプ
はがねタイプの　ポケモンは▽
すなあらしの　ダメージを　うけないぞ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T07:06:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>砂あらしは　大変だ！▼
だがな　いわタイプ　じめんタイプ
はがねタイプの　ポケモンは▽
砂あらしの　ダメージを　受けないぞ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T07:06:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：White2ver</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:20:48" />
		</CommentCell>
