				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-07T06:58:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみの　チュリネと
ぼくの　モンメンだったのが▼
きみの　モンメンと
ぼくの　チュリネに　なりました！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T11:11:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
